# wait_stopped_by_householder — a wait through the night in somebody's house ends at night
#
# Sitting on the storage barrel in a village pantry in the evening, choosing to wait until morning.
# The player is trespassing and the house has a householder, so the wait cannot run through the
# night: it stops at night, when they come in and find the player (ConfrontationKind.FoundWaiting).
# Night is not crossed into dawn, so no day turns.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type village --location-id 1 --start-area pantry --period evening --observe-only Storage

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal sit_and_wait
advance 12 180
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue

wait
click period morning
wait
click continue
advance 12 180

expect-outcome time_shift
expect-state where "period=Night day=0"
expect-state where "confronted=FoundWaiting"
quit
